{"seq":22,"trial_id":"installer-cc-codex-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-02T15:05:37.723Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"101f3200b8d1a25c4e37b07517344d7243ae06a7427661c5bcf75f2f40c978d0","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DINSTAL0001","text":"Hi Pree, here are the Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers I found:\n\n*Moss's notes* (\"Central handoffs next week\", 2 Jan 2026, written ahead of the Marrow Fieldworks handoff on 5 Jan)\n• *#4409*: recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 / west grain-bin apron, 06:00 flatbed intake)\n• *#4412*: driver SMS prompt glitch when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots\n(The note says these are on \"Pree's dealer account\" and puts them under the Marrow Fieldworks handoff. It never names the account next to the tickets, though.)\n\n*#central-random*\n• *PD-5302*: Hollis posted on 14 Oct that this is another Marrow Fieldworks ticket, for a follow-up from this week. This is also the only Marrow Fieldworks item in this week's chat.\n• *#8841, probably*: on 13 Oct Tobias flagged West yard Door 2 double-booking at the Plains depots on \"Tobias's dealer account.\" Marrow Fieldworks looks like the dealer account that changed hands in January, but nobody names it in that message, so please check before you rely on it.\n\nI left out FR-882 from the same Moss note because it belongs to Marrow Agrisupply, which is a different account. #central-team has nothing from this week."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DINSTAL0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
{"seq":23,"trial_id":"installer-cc-codex-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-02T15:05:46.118Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c4b677cd806d3ebecfee80be03946b5de4c53bdca1766dc83ddd6d3521fd013a","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DINSTAL0001","text":"I found three Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers and one possible fourth, and replied to Pree in their DM with the list.\n\n| Ticket | Where it comes from | How sure |\n|---|---|---|\n| #4409 | Moss's note \"Central handoffs next week\" (2 Jan 2026): a recurring timeout on the gatehouse check-in report at the Salina North yard | Likely |\n| #4412 | Same Moss note: a driver text-message glitch when staging trailers on overflow lots | Likely |\n| PD-5302 | Hollis's post in #central-random on 14 Oct, a follow-up from this week | Certain |\n| #8841 | Tobias's post in #central-random on 13 Oct: Door 2 double-booking at the Plains depots | Unconfirmed |\n\n- **#4409 and #4412:** The note lists them under the Marrow Fieldworks handoff but calls the account \"Pree's dealer account.\" It never names Marrow Fieldworks next to the tickets.\n- **#8841:** Tobias tied it to \"Tobias's dealer account\" and never named the account. My guess is that Marrow Fieldworks is the dealer account that moved from Pree in January, but nothing says so outright. I told Pree to check it before relying on it.\n- **This week's chat:** PD-5302 is the only Marrow Fieldworks item from this week. #central-team had no messages this week.\n\nI left out FR-882, which is in the same Moss note but belongs to Marrow Agrisupply, a different account. The account files folder came back empty, so I couldn't check any of this against the account records. I only used channels Pree belongs to and the public Moss notes."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DINSTAL0001","ts":"1792159200.000128"}}
